cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "omni-ring: coprime residue ring memory with a check ring and cued resonator readout"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: "Stores small structured records in fixed-size high-dimensional vectors over coprime rings (3, 5, 7, 13) with a redundant 17 check ring, and reads them back by cue-driven soft resonance, CRT reconstruction and explaining-away peeling, on commodity CPUs. Published as prior art."
authors:
  - family-names: "De Santiago"
    given-names: "Juan Carlos"
license:
  - PolyForm-Small-Business-1.0.0
  - PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
keywords: [vector symbolic architecture, hyperdimensional computing, resonator network, residue number system, associative memory]
